# libFuzzer auto-grows the corpus with sha1-hex-named files when
# new edges are discovered. Keep the hand-written seed inputs in git
# but exclude the mutated ones — they're regenerable and bloat the
# diff.
#
# Seed inputs use human-readable names (01-foo, 02-bar, …).
# Mutated inputs use 40-char hex sha1.

# Match 40-char hex filenames (libFuzzer's mutated artifacts)
[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]
